{
  "description": "Posting a transfer between banks, wallets, card settlement and the safe (posting rules §6, ACC-04, owner answer 6 to W1-19): Dr the destination with the amount less the charges, Dr the charges' category account with the charges (when above 0) / Cr the source with the amount. A bank account or category without an account is target_unmapped; the safe (null) is CASH_SAFE. No stock, no party.",
  "cases": [
    {
